{"id":"partida","lemma":"partida","pos":"noun","rank":1993,"glosses":["departure","match, lot, game (of cards, video games etc.)","passing (death)"],"ipa":"/paɾˈtida/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"partidas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/af/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-partida.wav","examples":[{"text":"¡Se acabó la partida!","en":"The game is over.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444410","words":[null,null,{"g":"the / her"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"enough is enough!…"]]},{"text":"He ganado la partida.","en":"I have won the game.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/514946","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"livestock, cattle"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Ellos estaban jugando una partida de damas.","en":"They were playing a game of checkers.","words":[{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to play","l":"jugar"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"checkers"}]},{"text":"Tom ganará esta partida.","en":"Tom will win this game.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/806090","words":[null,{"g":"to gain","l":"ganar"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null]},{"text":"Él ganará probablemente la partida.","en":"He is likely to win the game.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/598066","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to gain","l":"ganar"},{"g":"probably, likely"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}